PROCEDURE openQuery :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

OPEN QUERY {&QueryName} FOR EACH {&TableName} NO-LOCK.
RETURN "OK":U.

END PROCEDURE.

